
Error: Invalid quoted type constraints

  on main.tf line 2, in variable "tags":
   2:   type = "map"

OpenTofu 0.11 and earlier required type constraints to be given in quotes,
but that form is now deprecated and will be removed in a future version of
OpenTofu. Remove the quotes around "map" and write map(string) instead to
explicitly indicate that the map elements are strings.
